##objectives
Objectives of Hotel Complaint Maintenance Prediction System
To collect and manage hotel customer complaints in a centralized system.
To identify common maintenance issues from complaint data.
To predict future maintenance problems using historical complaint records.
To reduce complaint resolution time and improve service quality.
To help hotel management take preventive maintenance actions.
To improve customer satisfaction through faster issue handling.
To generate reports and insights for better decision-making.
To reduce maintenance costs by detecting problems early.
